      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T09:37:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The CL description talks about \"enabling long messages\".\n\nI have removed this in the commit message. The focus of this cl is to add the communication protocol library and introduce the CBOR serialize/deserialize mechanism.\n\nI checked again that the max message we can send here is 506 bytes. It might be related to the max buffer 1024 bytes defined in the virtio socket manager, I\u0027ll check it through. What about just land the current cl as it is since it\u0027s already big and does it job of adding the protocol lib?",
      "parentUuid": "1253f761_0efaa72a",
      "range": {
