      "writtenOn": "2023-08-24T13:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Vec\u003cu8\u003e is treated as a sequence of Positive numbers instead of a byte array\n\nI suspect making it an \u0026[u8] rather than a Vec\u003cu8\u003e, and adding a lifetime annotation, would fix that - and might be a good idea anyway, since it allows for one less copy on each end. https://serde.rs/lifetimes.html#borrowing-data-in-a-derived-impl\n\n\u003e I think it\u0027s logical to update it within the connection manager.\n\nAck, makes sense.",
